  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Eyewear Parts Bundle offers an innovative solution for both enthusiasts and professionals, allowing you to customize your sunglasses in your preferred colors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This kit includes a variety of essential components, and to complete the assembly, you'll need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts. Create your unique personalized sunglasses with ease!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files and obtain detailed information, please visit the Eyewear Parts Bundle A01 and Eyewear Parts Bundle A02 on Makerworld."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Eyewear Parts Bundle A01"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "You can also use Bambu 3D Effect Sheet to unlock and customize your own Eyewear Parts."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Eyewear Parts Bundle\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/303e98d4ebf34a5396203298fd8abf02/1_27b70942-5ecc-47a9-a495-efcf9642195f.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Eyewear Parts Bundle\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/303e98d4ebf34a5396203298fd8abf02/1_27b70942-5ecc-47a9-a495-efcf9642195f.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The <strong>Eyewear Parts Bundle</strong> offers an innovative solution for both enthusiasts and professionals, allowing you to customize your sunglasses in your preferred colors.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">This kit includes a variety of essential components, and to complete the assembly, you'll need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print </strong>the remaining parts. Create your unique personalized sunglasses with ease!</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"><br/>To download the model files and obtain detailed information, please visit the <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/536774#profileId-453715\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\">Eyewear Parts Bundle A01</a></strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">and</span> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\"><strong><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/536777#profileId-453719\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\">Eyewear Parts Bundle A02</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/536777#profileId-453719\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\"></a></strong></span> on <strong>Makerworld</strong>.</p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<br/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 254.719px;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 38.0874%; height: 19.5938px;\"><strong>Compatible Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 18.1626%; height: 19.5938px;\">\n<strong>Creators</strong><br/>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 39.7354%; height: 19.5938px;\"><b>Model Links</b></