  "description_text": "The Eyewear Parts Bundle offers an innovative solution for both enthusiasts and professionals, allowing you to customize your sunglasses in your preferred colors.\n\nThis kit includes a variety of essential components, and to complete the assembly, you'll need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts. Create your unique personalized sunglasses with ease!\n\nTo download the model files and obtain detailed information, please visit the Eyewear Parts Bundle A01 and Eyewear Parts Bundle A02 on Makerworld.\n\nCreator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.\n\nYou can also use Bambu 3D Effect Sheet to unlock and customize your own Eyewear Parts.",
